<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Lion's Bell</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #050505;
      --ink: #f6f0e3;
      --muted: #d1c5af;
      --gold: #d8b469;
      --gold-deep: #8d6a2f;
      --violet: #6f67ff;
      --violet-soft: rgba(111, 103, 255, 0.16);
      --red: #8f2f2f;
      --panel: rgba(13, 10, 18, 0.84);
      --line: rgba(244, 229, 193, 0.16);
      --shadow: 0 0 32px rgba(111, 103, 255, 0.14), 0 0 100px rgba(216, 180, 105, 0.08);
    }* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  color: var(--ink);
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 50% 18%, rgba(111,103,255,0.11), transparent 24%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 17% 12%, rgba(216,180,105,0.09), transparent 18%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 82% 14%, rgba(216,180,105,0.07), transparent 16%),
    linear-gradient(180deg, #020202 0%, #08050c 48%, #030303 100%);
  min-height: 100vh;
  overflow-x: hidden;
  position: relative;
}

body::before {
  content: "";
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  background-image:
    radial-gradient(circle at 8% 14%, rgba(255,255,255,0.95) 0 1px, transparent 2px),
    radial-gradient(circle at 18% 36%, rgba(216,180,105,0.95) 0 1px, transparent 2px),
    radial-gradient(circle at 24% 74%, rgba(255,255,255,0.84) 0 1px, transparent 2px),
    radial-gradient(circle at 78% 18%, rgba(255,255,255,0.9) 0 1px, transparent 2px),
    radial-gradient(circle at 87% 69%, rgba(216,180,105,0.9) 0 1px, transparent 2px),
    radial-gradient(circle at 65% 83%, rgba(255,255,255,0.7) 0 1px, transparent 2px),
    radial-gradient(circle at 50% 54%, rgba(255,255,255,0.4) 0 1px, transparent 2px);
  opacity: 0.85;
  z-index: 0;
}

body::after {
  content: "";
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  background:
    repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0 180px, rgba(255,255,255,0.01) 180px 181px),
    linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), transparent);
  opacity: 0.2;
  mix-blend-mode: screen;
  z-index: 0;
}

.sigil,
.sigil::before,
.sigil::after {
  position: absolute;
  border-radius: 50%;
  content: "";
  border: 1px solid rgba(216, 180, 105, 0.2);
}

.sigil {
  width: 33rem;
  height: 33rem;
  top: 6rem;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  opacity: 0.72;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 22px rgba(111,103,255,0.2));
  z-index: 0;
}

.sigil::before { inset: 2.8rem; }
.sigil::after { inset: 5.6rem; }

.sigil-mark {
  position: absolute;
  left: 50%;
  top: 14.7rem;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  z-index: 0;
  color: rgba(216,180,105,0.85);
  font-size: 2rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.4rem;
  text-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(111,103,255,0.25);
}

.page {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  width: min(1160px, calc(100% - 2rem));
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 1.2rem 0 5rem;
}

.nav {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 1rem;
  padding: 1rem 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.brand {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.14rem;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
}

.brand small {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 0.68rem;
}

.brand strong {
  font-size: 0.96rem;
  color: var(--ink);
}

.nav-links {
  display: flex;
  gap: 1.25rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.nav-links a,
.primary-btn,
.ghost-btn {
  text-decoration: none;
  color: var(--ink);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  font-size: 0.72rem;
}

.nav-links a:hover,
.primary-btn:hover,
.ghost-btn:hover {
  color: var(--gold);
}

.hero {
  min-height: 88vh;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  padding: 4rem 0 2rem;
  text-align: center;
  position: relative;
}

.hero-card {
  position: relative;
  width: min(1020px, 100%);
  padding: 3.3rem 1.5rem 2.9rem;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(19,14,24,0.44), rgba(8,8,11,0.22));
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 241, 214, 0.15);
  border-radius: 32px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
  overflow: hidden;
}

.hero-card::before,
.hero-card::after {
  position: absolute;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  color: rgba(216,180,105,0.82);
  white-space: nowrap;
  font-size: 0.92rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.72rem;
}

.hero-card::before {
  content: "♌ ✦ 🛡 ✦ ☾";
  top: 1rem;
}

.hero-card::after {
  content: "🛸 ✦ ⟁ ✦ 🔔";
  bottom: 1rem;
}

.eyebrow {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
  color: var(--gold);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.34em;
  font-size: 0.78rem;
}

.crest {
  width: 132px;
  height: 132px;
  margin: 0 auto 1.1rem;
  border-radius: 50%;
  border: 1px solid rgba(216,180,105,0.34);
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  position: relative;
  font-size: 2rem;
  color: var(--gold);
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 24px rgba(216,180,105,0.06), 0 0 24px rgba(111,103,255,0.1);
}

.crest::before,
.crest::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  border-radius: 50%;
  border: 1px solid rgba(216,180,105,0.18);
}

.crest::before { inset: 10px; }
.crest::after {
  inset: 25px;
  border-style: dashed;
}

.title {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: clamp(3rem, 9vw, 7rem);
  line-height: 0.92;
  letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  text-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(111,103,255,0.34), 0 0 2px rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
}

.title span { display: block; }

.subtitle {
  width: min(790px, 100%);
  margin: 1.4rem auto 0;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 1rem;
  line-height: 1.9;
  letter-spacing: 0.03em;
}

.hero-ornaments {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 1rem;
  margin: 1.75rem 0;
  color: var(--gold);
  font-size: 1.08rem;
}

.hero-ornaments .line {
  width: min(180px, 18vw);
  height: 1px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(216,180,105,0.75), transparent);
}

.hero-actions {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 1rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin-top: 1.8rem;
}

.primary-btn,
.ghost-btn {
  padding: 0.95rem 1.2rem;
  border-radius: 999px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(216,180,105,0.34);
  transition: 180ms ease;
}

.primary-btn {
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(216,180,105,0.18), rgba(111,103,255,0.12));
  box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(111,103,255,0.14);
}

.ghost-btn { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); }

.primary-btn:hover,
.ghost-btn:hover {
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  border-color: rgba(216,180,105,0.58);
}

.section {
  margin-top: 4.7rem;
}

.section-header {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}

.section-header h2 {
  margin: 0 0 0.7rem;
  font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
}

.section-header p {
  width: min(700px, 100%);
  margin: 0 auto;
  color: var(--muted);
  line-height: 1.85;
}

.grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 1rem;
}

.card {
  position: relative;
  background: var(--panel);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,243,219,0.12);
  border-radius: 24px;
  padding: 1.45rem;
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
}

.card::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(111,103,255,0.08), transparent 30%, transparent 70%, rgba(216,180,105,0.05));
  pointer-events: none;
}

.card::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 12px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(216,180,105,0.08);
  border-radius: 16px;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.glyph {
  color: var(--gold);
  font-size: 1.55rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
}

.card h3 {
  margin: 0 0 0.7rem;
  font-size: 1.15rem;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
}

.card p {
  margin: 0;
  color: var(--muted);
  line-height: 1.8;
  font-size: 0.97rem;
}

.manifesto {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
  gap: 1rem;
  align-items: stretch;
}

.scroll-panel,
.ritual-panel {
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(15,12,22,0.9), rgba(7,7,11,0.84));
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,244,220,0.12);
  border-radius: 28px;
  padding: 1.6rem;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.scroll-panel::after,
.ritual-panel::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 1rem;
  border: 1px solid rgba(216,180,105,0.12);
  border-radius: 20px;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.quote {
  font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.7vw, 2.15rem);
  line-height: 1.5;
  margin: 0;
  color: var(--ink);
}

.quote strong {
  color: var(--gold);
  font-weight: 600;
}

.list {
  display: grid;
  gap: 0.92rem;
  margin-top: 1.3rem;
}

.list-item {
  display: flex;
  gap: 0.8rem;
  align-items: flex-start;
  color: var(--muted);
  line-height: 1.75;
}

.list-item span:first-child {
  color: var(--gold);
}

.seal {
  margin-top: 1.2rem;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.75rem;
  border: 1px solid rgba(216,180,105,0.22);
  border-radius: 999px;
  padding: 0.7rem 1rem;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  color: var(--gold);
}

.ritual-panel h3 {
  margin-top: 0;
  font-size: 1rem;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  color: var(--gold);
}

.ritual-panel .symbol {
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 5rem;
  line-height: 1;
  margin: 1rem 0;
  text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(111,103,255,0.35);
}

.ritual-panel p {
  color: var(--muted);
  line-height: 1.8;
  text-align: center;
}

.footer {
  margin-top: 4rem;
  padding-top: 1.5rem;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  text-align: center;
  color: var(--muted);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  font-size: 0.72rem;
}

@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .grid,
  .manifesto {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .nav {
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .hero {
    min-height: auto;
    padding-top: 3rem;
  }

  .hero-card {
    padding-inline: 1rem;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 560px) {
  .page {
    width: min(100% - 1rem, 1160px);
  }

  .nav-links {
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .title {
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 16vw, 4.3rem);
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 0.94rem;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .hero-ornaments .line {
    width: 20vw;
  }
}

  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="sigil" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="sigil-mark" aria-hidden="true">♌ ✦ 🛡 ✦ 🛸</div>  <main class="page">
    <nav class="nav">
      <div class="brand">
        <small>Borderline Sciences Research Observatory</small>
        <strong>Lion's Bell</strong>
      </div><div class="nav-links">
    <a href="#doctrine">Doctrine</a>
    <a href="#watch">Skywatch</a>
    <a href="#archive">Archive</a>
    <a href="#initiation">Initiation</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="hero-card">
    <div class="eyebrow">Chivalric Esoterica · Celestial Inquiry · Hidden Observatory</div>
    <div class="crest">♌</div>

    <h1 class="title">
      <span>Lion's</span>
      <span>Bell</span>
    </h1>

    <div class="hero-ornaments" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="line"></div>
      <div>🛡 ✦ ☾ ✦ 🛸 ✦ 🔔</div>
      <div class="line"></div>
    </div>

    <p class="subtitle">
      A veiled order of knight-observers devoted to the study of celestial omens, unidentified craft, and sacred resonance. In Lion's Bell, the sword, the star map, and the transmission log are kept side by side. We do not separate myth from signal. We guard both until the sky speaks clearly.
    </p>

    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="primary-btn" href="#initiation">Seek Admission</a>
      <a class="ghost-btn" href="#archive">Open the Archive</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="doctrine">
  <div class="section-header">
    <h2>The Lion Doctrine</h2>
    <p>
      Lion's Bell unites mystical discipline, heraldic ceremony, and ufological research into a single hidden order. Every anomaly is treated as both evidence and omen.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid">
    <article class="card">
      <div class="glyph">🛡</div>
      <h3>Chivalric Vigil</h3>
      <p>
        Members stand as sworn guardians of forbidden knowledge, keeping watch over skyborne signs, ancient reports, and sealed field observations.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <div class="glyph">🛸</div>
      <h3>Ufological Inquiry</h3>
      <p>
        Our observatory catalogues impossible lights, silent craft, geometric apparitions, and transmissions that behave more like intelligence than weather.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <div class="glyph">🔔</div>
      <h3>The Bell Oath</h3>
      <p>
        The bell is struck when the unseen nears. It signifies awakening, summons, and the sacred duty to witness what others refuse to name.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="archive">
  <div class="section-header">
    <h2>The Sealed Archive</h2>
    <p>
      Behind the inner vault lie watch reports, sigil diagrams, knightly vows, encounter transcripts, lunar charts, and annotated sightings gathered beneath oath.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="manifesto">
    <div class="scroll-panel">
      <p class="quote">
        “We are custodians of the <strong>radiant unknown</strong>, where heraldry meets the heavens, and where every light above may conceal a message, a vessel, or a visitation.”
      </p>

      <div class="list">
        <div class="list-item"><span>✦</span><span>Preserve accounts of silent craft, impossible symmetries, and lights that return with intention.</span></div>
        <div class="list-item"><span>✦</span><span>Maintain ceremonial forms through which observation becomes rite and rite becomes disciplined research.</span></div>
        <div class="list-item"><span>✦</span><span>Guard the names, coordinates, insignia, and correspondences entrusted to Lion's Bell.</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="seal">♌ Sanctioned by the Solar Chapter</div>
    </div>

    <aside class="ritual-panel" id="watch">
      <h3>Current Skywatch Rite</h3>
      <div class="symbol">🛸</div>
      <p>
        At moonrise, face the eastern dark. Ring the bell once for warning, once for passage, and once for the intelligences that drift just beyond common sight.
      </p>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="initiation">
  <div class="section-header">
    <h2>Initiation into the Bell</h2>
    <p>
      Admission is offered only to those who can hold silence, endure mystery, and witness the sky without demanding that wonder become ordinary.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid">
    <article class="card">
      <div class="glyph">I</div>
      <h3>The Report</h3>
      <p>
        Present one worthy anomaly: a dream, a signal, a sighting, or an event whose pattern cannot be dismissed by habit alone.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <div class="glyph">II</div>
      <h3>The Vow</h3>
      <p>
        Swear upon the bell and crest that no rite, archive, location, or witness name shall be surrendered to the uninitiated.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <div class="glyph">III</div>
      <h3>The Summons</h3>
      <p>
        If accepted, you will be marked by sign: in dream, in static, in sealed correspondence, or in a light crossing the midnight field.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="footer">
  Lion's Bell · Borderline Sciences Research Observatory · Established Beyond Public Record
</footer>

  </main>
</body>
</html>
